0..75 Comment "// The refusals beside `../../model/modules/model-laws.gandr`: a model that"
76..155 Comment "// leaves out a law whose sides do not convert is refused `NoFiller.Omitted` by"
156..232 Comment "// the law\'s name, at the module, whose attributes state the expectation; an"
233..295 Comment "// admission at a carrier the host does not provide is refused"
296..370 Comment "// `UnprovenLaw.Admitted` at the admission, the law the author\'s to prove."
371..448 Comment "// Float equality is symmetric and transitive but not reflexive, NaN equal to"
449..525 Comment "// nothing: a model of `Eq` at `f64` admits `sym`, and its `refl` is refused"
526..602 Comment "// whether admitted or left out, so floats are a model of `PartialEq` alone."
604..647 Comment "/// Reflexivity and symmetry of a decision."
